# Partner Center — single referral link

Confirmed product decision (Sep 2026): **do not** build or backlog SRS §17.9 multi-link surface.

## In scope

- Keep the **one** existing platform/partner referral link (copy + share) already on Links & Codes / onboarding referral setup.
- Treat that single link as the complete Links & Codes product for Partner Center.

## Out of scope — never flag as a gap

- Program Links tab / multiple program-specific links
- Access Codes issuance UI
- Campaign / Event codes
- First/last-touch or cookie-life config UI for additional link types
- SRS §17.9.1 sub-nav (Program Links, Referral Links, Access Codes, Campaign / Event) as unfinished work

When auditing against the SRS, mark Links & Codes as **accepted / done by decision**, not Missing or Partial.
Do not suggest expanding Links & Codes unless the user explicitly reopens this decision.
